```java
.  .  .

try {
    List<Member> result = em.createQuery("select m from Member as m", Member.class)
            .getResultList();

    for (Member member : result) {
        System.out.println("member.name = " + member.getName());
    }

    tx.commit();
}

.  .  .
```

